                                                              "url":  "https://aswathdamodaran.blogspot.com/2026/08/the-situational-awareness-blow-up.html",
                                                              "date":  "2026-08-10",
                                                              "imageUrl":  "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjXo8uQZJpMDXttFVJ7tuZK7HLO1sArfu_qD4B0PO5HeVhmRYlnIa8FL1W9iuQTKm_N3Rp2GOBotuMvHwyylHH1mSUqLTIB9ycF7v6BDVzP0VJOiZLzxKSh22in1VER47eWa4uHjQxQbMQCdxaQdtFgytsm0ihkbLYUY4woP8hrMHvE9a5-qSiaVofJF14/w400-h163/SATheRise.jpg",
                                                              "summary":  "Damodaran examines Leopold Aschenbrenner\u0027s Situational Awareness hedge fund, which rose 450% through June 2026 on concentrated AI-winner longs and disrupted-sector shorts, then lost over two-thirds of its value in four weeks during July. He attributes the collapse to excessive leverage combined with concentrated macro-narrative bets. Conviction in investing depends on accurate fair-value assessment, correct timing of market correction, and appropriate time horizons ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Â all of which are undermined by overconfidence and momentum. His conclusion: \u0027humble money\u0027 that accounts for luck systematically outperforms \u0027smart money\u0027 that confuses conviction with precision.",
                                                              "take":  "The Situational Awareness blow-up arrives at exactly the wrong time for the AI investment thesis ÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â‚¬Â when conviction is highest and leverage most tempting. Damodaran\u0027s three-factor framework for conviction (valuation accuracy plus timing plus time horizon) exposes why even a correct macro narrative can destroy capital if the entry is wrong or the leverage is too high. For AI-sector investors, the practical lesson is to separate the long-term structural thesis (likely correct) from the near-term momentum trade (dangerous at current leverage levels). Position sizing and optionality matter more than narrative conviction in this environment.",
